{"3897790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Null Anchor", "steam_appid": 3897790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/a329c135e272effc909ae0923b6e728a.poster.avif?t=1758125383\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/a329c135e272effc909ae0923b6e728a.webm?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/a329c135e272effc909ae0923b6e728a.mp4?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You're one in 9 million. A citizen of a dystopia far from earth. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unrest threatens, authority crushes, over-population smothers. </i></strong> <br><strong><i>You're a scav, a pilot. One of the free, one able to escape the crowding - to fly and earn. </i></strong> <br><strong><i>The skies beckon.. threaten.. </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>But will you use your freedom for good?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Null Anchor gives you the simple joy of customization, combat and flight WITHOUT needing a joystick, a 1 hour YouTube tutorial or a pledge for the game to release in over a decade ;-P </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/1c0e73985280276210e642380a0df419.poster.avif?t=1758125383\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/1c0e73985280276210e642380a0df419.webm?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/1c0e73985280276210e642380a0df419.mp4?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born out of a 90s kid's dream to be an adult in a SCIFI future; you survive in a teeming city, earning a living by whatever means, upgrading your hunk of metal, honing your dogfighting skills and building an empire in this crater-land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/568430746702145cf234c9bbed6b643c.avif?t=1758125383\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've tried to shatter the barrier to entry by using simple WASD and FPS control schemes, steering clear of complex game logic and implementing intuitive combat and damage systems. Utilizing a simplified flight model with no inversion, helps players concentrate on strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/a329c135e272effc909ae0923b6e728a.poster.avif?t=1758125383\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/a329c135e272effc909ae0923b6e728a.webm?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/a329c135e272effc909ae0923b6e728a.mp4?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You're one in 9 million. A citizen of a dystopia far from earth. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unrest threatens, authority crushes, over-population smothers. </i></strong> <br><strong><i>You're a scav, a pilot. One of the free, one able to escape the crowding - to fly and earn. </i></strong> <br><strong><i>The skies beckon.. threaten.. </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>But will you use your freedom for good?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Null Anchor gives you the simple joy of customization, combat and flight WITHOUT needing a joystick, a 1 hour YouTube tutorial or a pledge for the game to release in over a decade ;-P </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/1c0e73985280276210e642380a0df419.poster.avif?t=1758125383\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/1c0e73985280276210e642380a0df419.webm?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/1c0e73985280276210e642380a0df419.mp4?t=1758125383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born out of a 90s kid's dream to be an adult in a SCIFI future; you survive in a teeming city, earning a living by whatever means, upgrading your hunk of metal, honing your dogfighting skills and building an empire in this crater-land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/extras/568430746702145cf234c9bbed6b643c.avif?t=1758125383\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've tried to shatter the barrier to entry by using simple WASD and FPS control schemes, steering clear of complex game logic and implementing intuitive combat and damage systems. Utilizing a simplified flight model with no inversion, helps players concentrate on strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Null anchor is a space-sim-lite where you fly, fight, scavenge, steal, trade, refuel, upgrade, repair, evade cops, hunt bounties and run, because you can't hide.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/128064d8d2ba64372d01122f985f307f9c3e455a/header.jpg?t=1758125383", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/6b39ac111683d36fa65a7b6ab0372afeceebc140/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758125383", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897790/6b39ac111683d36fa65a7b6ab0372afeceebc140/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758125383", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 and up<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Gen 6 and up<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No VR support yet</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and up<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7 Gen 8 and higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1070 <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br